{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受词在S01、S05、S07等处有些重复和堆叠，个别叙述还加入了原文未明确支持的推断，如“让对方安心”“也许能互相依靠”，Y在这些地方更克制、稳妥。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的观众，X的加亮词能迅速抓住每段真正发生的心理变化，话语和感受交替排列，也比Y左右两栏更容易判断某种感受对应哪一层心理活动。尤其是X把不少感受放到具体音乐节点才出现，既能呈现情绪逐渐变化的过程，又不用一次消化所有短词；水波、船、摇荡、靠岸等意象也让感受有了连续性和具体质感。Y的叙述本身并不差，甚至S14对开头的回扣更直接，但它的右栏容易变成一组同时摆在眼前的情绪标签，音乐进行中的细微变化没有X那么容易被观众捕捉。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "05657d15-772a-44ee-b525-0a81bfc9d6db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T005739818855Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:59:10.340633+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66414fbbf02399ce7b1aef95c23df64c7d802ea1dd7e816be4435a733d994644", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f